e=\"font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman','Noto Serif KR',serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:7px 0 7px;font-weight:700;\">좋은 생각은<br>어디에서 오는가</h2>\n    <p style=\"font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman','Noto Serif KR',serif;font-size:10px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--card-fg-muted);margin:0;\">천천히 읽고, 오래 관찰하고, 나만의 문장으로 남기는 일에 대하여.</p>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:auto;padding-top:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid var(--card-border);font-size:8px;color:var(--card-fg-muted);\">\n      <span>MINA PARK · 6분 읽기</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:11px;\">♡&nbsp;&nbsp;▢&nbsp;&nbsp;↗</span>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</div>","card_tokens":{"light":{"bg":"#FFFFFF","surface":"#F7F5F2","border":"#E8E4DE","fg":"#191918","fg_muted":"#77736F","accent":"#FF6719"},"dark":{"bg":"#171716","surface":"#242321","border":"#3A3835","fg":"#F5F2ED","fg_muted":"#AAA49C","accent":"#FF6719"}}}